# Local-preview mirror only: `cp output/data.json web/data.json` lets the site
# be served from web/ without a backend. Generated, never committed. Matched by
# exact path rather than web/*.json so a future real file under web/ (like the
# tracked web/insights/mock-insights.json) can't be hidden by accident.
web/data.json
